    fix(docs): GAP-041 — ruff format drift in two tracked markdown code fences
    
    Ruff 0.16.0 formats code fences inside tracked markdown, so `ruff format
    --check .` failed on two files: skills/h3-shim-usage/SKILL.md (re-drifted by
    the dogfood commit 98c1d84, one tick after the GAP-039 fix e4eaef2) and
    docs/dogfood/2026-09-05-integration.md (from dogfood commit 2829548).
    
    Mechanical `ruff format` only — the two embedded multi-line lambdas are
    re-wrapped; no prose, no code semantics, no test-count changes.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
